  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Added Cyphal/CAN transport support (CanFrame, CanTransport, CanProtocol).\n\t\t\t- Implemented multi-frame reassembly for CAN with CRC-16-CCITT verification.\n\t\t\t- Improved DSDL parsing with service bit preservation and CAN-compliant fallback Port IDs.\n\t\t\t- Fixed C# 14 compatibility for 'field' keyword in property accessors.\n\t\t\t- Added comprehensive unit tests for the CAN transport layer.",
